{"uid":"2a30921efca0a5f1","name":"test_resolve_refuses_another_users_unshared_personal_tool","fullName":"tests.test_workspace_release_tool_adapter#test_resolve_refuses_another_users_unshared_personal_tool","historyId":"b3d1cf809a492e62733e47f2b4fd4994","time":{"start":1791969864963,"stop":1791969864978,"duration":15},"description":"The actual disclosure this fix guards against from the start: a\n    personal tool (``project_id=None``, ``visibility=\"user\"``) has the\n    *same* ``None`` project id as a public tool, so a bare\n    ``row.project_id != caller's project`` comparison could not tell them\n    apart and would let any caller snapshot another user's unshared personal\n    tool by name -- must be refused, the same way ``routes/tools.py``'s own\n    ``_visible_tool_or_404`` already refuses it for every tool route.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The actual disclosure this fix guards against from the start: a<br />\npersonal tool (<code>project_id=None</code>, <code>visibility=&quot;user&quot;</code>) has the<br />\n<em>same</em> <code>None</code> project id as a public tool, so a bare<br />\n<code>row.project_id != caller's project</code> comparison could not tell them<br />\napart and would let any caller snapshot another user's unshared personal<br />\ntool by name -- must be refused, the same way <code>routes/tools.py</code>'s own<br />\n<code>_visible_tool_or_404</code> already refuses it for every tool route.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791968319311,"stop":1791968319312,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791968319361,"stop":1791968319361,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"paramete